sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DEV as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub (200-project repo)
    participant GHA as GitHub Actions
    participant SQ as SonarQube (web)
    participant CE as Compute Engine<br/>1 worker, FIFO queue
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    DEV->>GH: merge to main
    GH->>GHA: push to main (NOT pull_request)
    Note over GHA: concurrency: sonar-${{ github.repository }}<br/>cancel-in-progress: true
    GHA->>GHA: build + tests + coverage
    GHA->>SQ: sonarqube-scan-action · POST /api/ce/submit
    SQ->>CE: queues the task
    Note over CE: with 200 projects, at peak hours<br/>the queue is the bottleneck
    CE->>DB: processes the report, persists it
    CE->>SQ: indexes into ES
    GHA->>SQ: waits on the quality gate (timeout 300 s)
    SQ-->>GHA: OK / ERROR
    GHA-->>GH: green / red check on the main commit
